<title>UK: Caisse Centrale Desjardins sets C$300 mln FRN. [CORRECTED 09:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Caisse Centrale Desjardins sets C$300 mln FRN. [CORRECTED 09:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DESJARDINS DU QUEBEC</p>
<p> AMT    C$300 MLN     BASE	 C$ BAS    MATURITY    21.MAY.02</p>
<p>(Corrects base to C$ BAS from 3M-LIBOR)</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/16 PCT  PAY DATE  L-20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.8935   FULL FEES   0.1875</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.8935</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   QUEBEC/CAN HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.0875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
